url: https://github.com/KonkovDV/SynAPS-MobiRoute
abstract: >-
  Experimental explainable optimization kernel for accessible demand-responsive
  transport planning (Dial-a-Ride / PDPTW) with accessibility constraints,
  fairness metrics, disruption recovery, and synthetic benchmarks.
  Validated on synthetic instances only; not a production CAD/AVL platform.
